<!-- DRY RUN ONLY: the RDCore.SDK packages from a local folder feed, restored into a packages folder of their own so that
     this machine's global packages folder never caches a dry-run build under the version nuget.org will publish.
     The real PR drops this file and restores RDCore.SDK from nuget.org. -->
<configuration>
